WEBVTT

00:02.377 --> 00:03.461
Hey, fucker.

00:07.340 --> 00:08.258
Who was it?

00:16.599 --> 00:17.434
Hey.

00:20.645 --> 00:22.063
Didn't I tell ya

00:22.856 --> 00:24.858
not to fuck around while you're working?

00:28.403 --> 00:29.487
I mean, what the hell?

00:33.742 --> 00:34.659
I apologize.

00:36.870 --> 00:37.704
Hey.

00:39.831 --> 00:40.999
Seok-dae oppa's cousin,

00:41.624 --> 00:43.293
said someone beat him up,

00:43.960 --> 00:44.961
so we went to help.

00:45.045 --> 00:47.547
You decided to help,
and you got your ass kicked?

00:48.423 --> 00:50.050
I wouldn't exactly say
he got his ass kicked.

00:50.133 --> 00:50.800
Shut up.

00:59.476 --> 01:00.310
Okay.

01:03.605 --> 01:04.939
Let's make them pay for it.

01:05.648 --> 01:06.232
Hm?

01:06.733 --> 01:07.525
Hm?

01:09.611 --> 01:10.445
Hey!

01:15.825 --> 01:16.451
Hey.

01:16.951 --> 01:17.786
We'll split it.

01:17.869 --> 01:18.495
Yeah?

01:18.995 --> 01:19.871
I'll give you half.

01:46.773 --> 01:48.983
WEAK HERO:
CLASS 1

02:46.416 --> 02:47.917
Look what Hyung's about to do.

02:49.919 --> 02:51.379
- Ooh.
- Okay!

02:51.462 --> 02:52.589
Mark ten points.

02:55.967 --> 02:58.344
We should be studying for our assessment,
right?

03:02.390 --> 03:03.474
Yeah, you're right.

03:04.309 --> 03:05.226
Si-eun-ssi.

03:05.852 --> 03:07.145
Bro, it's the weekend.

03:07.228 --> 03:10.732
Yeah? We need to let our blood circulate
so our brains can function better.

03:10.815 --> 03:13.234
We need to have a little fun,
once in a while.

03:15.403 --> 03:16.654
You're not going to college?

03:17.155 --> 03:18.531
Man, almost.

03:19.574 --> 03:21.451
Climbing back into hell? Huh?

03:21.534 --> 03:23.036
Are you literally insane?

03:23.828 --> 03:24.871
Get up, your turn.

03:28.374 --> 03:31.544
Get up and play. Don't play hard to get!

03:32.128 --> 03:33.296
Woo! This guy.

03:42.222 --> 03:43.181
Reflection principle.

03:43.681 --> 03:46.726
The incident angle and the reflection
angle are the same from the center of

03:46.809 --> 03:47.727
the billiard ball.

03:48.770 --> 03:49.979
Incident angle, thirty-five degrees.

03:50.063 --> 03:53.942
Margin of error, within three degrees.
Probability of success, ninety percent.

04:01.783 --> 04:02.617
Ohh.

04:04.035 --> 04:05.203
Let's go study.

04:10.667 --> 04:12.543
Where you going? We play three rounds.

04:13.044 --> 04:14.545
A hundred points, to start off.

04:14.629 --> 04:15.255
Okay?

04:19.467 --> 04:21.302
I think it'll be the same result.

04:21.886 --> 04:22.720
Ah, shit.

04:23.763 --> 04:24.639
Ya think so?

04:24.722 --> 04:25.390
Huh?

04:25.890 --> 04:26.975
You think it'll be the same?

04:27.058 --> 04:28.685
Let's bet on jjajangmyeon and tangsuyuk.

04:29.769 --> 04:31.020
No wait, gochu japchae.

04:31.521 --> 04:32.730
Are you in, bro?

04:42.365 --> 04:43.366
Come on!

04:48.037 --> 04:49.455
You know I went easy on ya.

04:50.415 --> 04:51.457
No you didn't.

04:51.541 --> 04:53.293
Agh, I feel so miserable, shit.

04:53.876 --> 04:56.004
Whatever. Let's grab a beer.

04:56.963 --> 04:59.132
I'm leaving. Go ahead.

05:00.174 --> 05:01.634
Why? Let's go together.

05:01.718 --> 05:02.552
I got it.

05:02.635 --> 05:04.762
You guys already put me behind schedule.

05:05.638 --> 05:07.015
Alright, get home safe.

05:07.098 --> 05:08.474
It'll be us two.

05:09.517 --> 05:12.478
You got lucky today,
man. Next time, I won't go easy on ya.

05:15.815 --> 05:18.484
- So um, where should we go grab drinks?
- Hey, come on.

05:18.568 --> 05:19.986
Hurry up, follow me.

05:38.796 --> 05:39.630
Hyung,

05:40.173 --> 05:41.007
what's with your arm?

05:44.510 --> 05:45.803
What do you think?

05:46.304 --> 05:48.306
It's all your fault, little hyung.

05:51.476 --> 05:52.310
What?

05:54.479 --> 05:55.063
Who are you?

05:56.939 --> 05:58.441
That's none of your business.

05:59.150 --> 06:01.319
But I need you to do me a favor.

06:32.475 --> 06:33.476
- Hello.
- Fuck.

06:33.559 --> 06:34.852
What the hell's doing here?

06:34.936 --> 06:35.853
I'm fucked.

06:38.022 --> 06:39.524
Can I help you find something?

06:41.192 --> 06:42.735
It's thirteen thousand won.

06:43.486 --> 06:44.695
Oppa, you almost done?

06:44.779 --> 06:45.822
They don't have what I want.

06:46.447 --> 06:47.573
Thank you.

06:48.491 --> 06:50.493
Hurry up, I'm hungry. Thanks a lot.

06:51.119 --> 06:51.994
Let's go.

06:56.666 --> 06:57.291
What?

06:57.792 --> 06:59.001
It's pouring rain out here.

07:00.711 --> 07:01.421
Ah, man.

07:01.921 --> 07:03.548
Why's it raining so much?

07:04.424 --> 07:05.299
Wait a sec!

07:09.720 --> 07:10.930
I don't have an umbrella.

07:15.935 --> 07:17.270
Walk me home, it's pouring.

07:17.854 --> 07:18.479
Why should I?

07:18.980 --> 07:20.815
Because you have an umbrella and I don't.

07:20.898 --> 07:22.066
Do you like tteokbokki?

07:22.150 --> 07:23.192
- No.
- Oh.

07:23.276 --> 07:24.944
I know a great tteokbokki
place over there.

07:25.027 --> 07:26.195
It'll change your mind.

07:27.947 --> 07:28.781
Mmm.

07:29.449 --> 07:30.575
It's really spicy.

07:33.244 --> 07:34.078
Hey.

07:35.705 --> 07:36.831
Is it alright if I leave?

07:37.331 --> 07:38.541
No, you can't leave.

07:40.001 --> 07:42.295
- Why not?
- I don't like to eat when I'm alone.

07:44.547 --> 07:45.715
Why aren't you eating?

07:45.798 --> 07:46.591
Too spicy?

07:47.508 --> 07:48.593
Why would you eat this?

07:49.927 --> 07:51.137
You don't have any friends, huh?

07:57.977 --> 07:59.270
That's my number. Save it.

07:59.896 --> 08:00.855
What's your name?

08:02.773 --> 08:03.608
Why?

08:07.737 --> 08:10.698
Because you seem like a
selfish and rude asshole.

08:11.991 --> 08:13.910
Guys like you are kinda my style.

08:16.787 --> 08:18.206
Thank you for the food.

08:23.753 --> 08:25.004
I'm gonna go. See ya later.

08:25.588 --> 08:26.506
Sorry about before.

08:29.133 --> 08:30.092
Yeah, I'm coming.

08:30.593 --> 08:32.094
I'm heading over now.

08:33.387 --> 08:34.180
Uh-huh.

08:44.774 --> 08:45.399
Where's Yeong-i?

08:45.900 --> 08:47.151
On her way back.

08:50.780 --> 08:52.740
- Go, you shit.
- Gil-su hyung inside?

08:53.324 --> 08:54.116
Uh-huh.

08:56.035 --> 08:56.744
Nice work.

08:57.245 --> 09:00.081
Hey, this crazy kid brought his mom's car.

09:01.082 --> 09:02.250
- Idiot.
- That's awesome.

09:02.333 --> 09:03.334
He's out of his mind.

09:05.127 --> 09:06.420
Hey, fucking asshole.

09:07.421 --> 09:09.590
I told you not to ignore my calls,
didn't I?

09:10.758 --> 09:11.842
I'm sorry.

09:11.926 --> 09:12.718
You're sorry?

09:14.929 --> 09:16.639
What are you gonna do to pay me back?

09:19.517 --> 09:20.977
I'll get it from my mom.

09:24.105 --> 09:25.356
I'll give you three days.

09:26.065 --> 09:27.858
If you don't have the money by then,

09:28.818 --> 09:31.237
Your shitty parents'll be fucking dead,
you got it?

09:31.737 --> 09:32.738
Huh?

09:32.822 --> 09:34.574
And I'll burn your house down too.

09:44.375 --> 09:45.334
Did it go well?

09:45.960 --> 09:46.794
Yes.

09:48.212 --> 09:49.005
Whoa.

09:49.088 --> 09:49.880
Good job.

09:51.424 --> 09:53.134
That little bastard.

09:53.217 --> 09:54.260
Hey,

09:54.343 --> 09:57.847
will you beat him up for like thirty
minutes before kicking him out?

09:57.930 --> 09:59.515
Or you can just stab him.

10:22.455 --> 10:23.789
- It's coming out.
- Hey, look, look, look.

10:23.873 --> 10:24.749
- The thunder.
- I see it.

10:24.832 --> 10:25.708
Right there.

10:26.667 --> 10:28.044
Wait, I'm gonna do this one.

10:29.170 --> 10:30.171
Su-ho-ya, the car.

10:30.254 --> 10:31.964
- Oh yeah the car.
- Get in it. Get in, get in.

10:32.048 --> 10:33.090
Was that the only one?

10:33.174 --> 10:35.384
Oh, here. I'm gonna take this one instead.

10:35.468 --> 10:37.762
- I want that one.
- Take the other one, let me have this.

10:37.845 --> 10:38.763
- Hey.
- Yeon Si-eun.

10:44.185 --> 10:45.770
Can I talk to you for a minute?

10:47.897 --> 10:48.981
I don't have anything to say.

10:49.482 --> 10:50.483
Hey,

10:51.108 --> 10:52.151
what do you want now?

10:56.656 --> 10:57.657
I'll be real quick.

11:04.497 --> 11:05.665
Please help me out here.

11:07.750 --> 11:09.794
Will you meet with my attorney just once?

11:11.253 --> 11:12.296
All you have to do

11:12.880 --> 11:15.091
is just tell him that
it wasn't my fentanyl.

11:17.426 --> 11:18.344
Beom-seok, you too.

11:21.889 --> 11:23.307
I'm the only reason

11:23.391 --> 11:25.184
that my mom wakes up in the morning.

11:28.938 --> 11:29.605
Please help me.

11:30.189 --> 11:32.441
Or else,
I'll end up going to a reformatory.

11:34.610 --> 11:36.487
This crying act isn't fooling anybody.

11:38.781 --> 11:39.615
Si-eun-a.

11:40.950 --> 11:42.535
Should we just make a statement?

11:43.494 --> 11:45.162
It wouldn't be that hard.

12:17.987 --> 12:18.821
Hey,

12:19.572 --> 12:20.906
why are you going to the basement?

12:20.990 --> 12:21.574
Oh,

12:22.074 --> 12:23.033
it's a shortcut.

12:24.618 --> 12:26.120
I'll kill you if you're lying.

12:26.746 --> 12:27.830
I'm not lying.

12:31.041 --> 12:31.709
Hey, hurry up.

12:33.210 --> 12:34.545
What should we eat for dinner?

12:34.628 --> 12:35.546
I'm going to the hagwon.

12:36.046 --> 12:37.089
Come on.

12:37.757 --> 12:38.966
You always say that.

12:39.467 --> 12:42.636
Let's go get a bowl of jjajangmyeon
and go to the internet café later.

12:43.137 --> 12:45.055
It's okay for you to skip work today?

12:45.139 --> 12:46.390
Oh. Do I have work?

12:46.474 --> 12:47.600
Darn it.

12:52.980 --> 12:54.023
Guess I won' make it.

13:01.739 --> 13:02.656
I expected this.

13:04.575 --> 13:06.786
Hey, little hyungs. Nice to meet ya.

13:25.721 --> 13:26.597
Seok-dae-ya,

13:26.680 --> 13:27.807
was it them?

13:29.600 --> 13:30.434
Yes.

13:34.855 --> 13:36.023
Well, as you may know,

13:36.524 --> 13:37.817
my dear Seok-dae

13:38.651 --> 13:40.694
had to go to the hospital because of you.

13:41.529 --> 13:42.363
I mean,

13:42.446 --> 13:44.198
he doesn't even have insurance.

13:44.698 --> 13:46.659
How could you beat him up like that?

13:47.201 --> 13:48.202
What is it you want?

13:50.371 --> 13:51.497
I'll give you three days.

13:53.207 --> 13:55.292
Bring fifteen million won, to me.

13:57.878 --> 13:58.879
That's bullshit.

13:58.963 --> 13:59.588
Hey,

14:00.089 --> 14:01.131
what's up with the cast?

14:01.882 --> 14:03.425
I never touched your arm, man.

14:03.509 --> 14:07.054
You don't even remember break-break-
breaking his arm like this?

14:07.137 --> 14:09.390
- You little piece of shit.
- But…

14:10.933 --> 14:12.476
Do you have evidence that it was us?

14:14.311 --> 14:15.145
Wow.

14:18.107 --> 14:21.235
Man, these little hyungs
are freakin' wild.

14:21.735 --> 14:22.570
Hey.

14:25.030 --> 14:26.824
I kill people for less money.

14:28.325 --> 14:30.160
Sometimes I'll break a limb if I want.

14:30.244 --> 14:31.370
Bragging about that

14:31.871 --> 14:33.998
- is childish.
- This mother fucker.

14:39.295 --> 14:40.629
Are you kidding?

14:44.341 --> 14:45.593
I'll give you three days.

14:47.261 --> 14:48.637
If you don't bring me my money,

14:49.972 --> 14:51.807
you'll be borrowing it from me then.

14:56.020 --> 14:57.646
You rude little prick.

15:00.608 --> 15:01.525
Let's go.

15:24.173 --> 15:25.299
Are you okay, Su-ho-ya?

15:27.593 --> 15:28.802
Not at all. Fuck.

15:28.886 --> 15:30.095
- Hold on.
- Okay.

15:32.723 --> 15:33.599
What do we do?

15:34.808 --> 15:35.684
They can't do anything.

15:36.185 --> 15:37.227
Ow, shit.

15:41.440 --> 15:42.900
I don't know why it's not starting.

15:42.983 --> 15:43.859
They said it'd run.

15:43.943 --> 15:44.985
Hey, yeah.

15:50.199 --> 15:51.200
Kids are coming out.

16:06.590 --> 16:07.800
I'll go with you, when you go.

16:08.300 --> 16:09.802
I'll look over it again.

16:17.267 --> 16:18.018
Is that him?

16:20.145 --> 16:20.980
Hey.

16:27.444 --> 16:28.696
We're just hanging out.

16:29.738 --> 16:33.075
- Yeah, I could really eat something.
- What's he looking at?

16:34.952 --> 16:35.911
Yeah, dude.

17:09.653 --> 17:10.487
Hello?

17:11.196 --> 17:12.406
Let's meet somewhere.

17:38.265 --> 17:39.308
That guy.

17:39.391 --> 17:40.559
What does he do?

17:41.101 --> 17:41.935
Who?

17:44.855 --> 17:45.689
Oh.

17:47.024 --> 17:47.775
Gil-su?

17:50.944 --> 17:51.695
That guy

17:52.196 --> 17:54.031
lets us crash and gives us a job.

17:55.032 --> 17:55.616
What kind?

17:56.116 --> 17:57.159
You know, this and that.

17:58.535 --> 17:59.787
Why do you care?

18:06.168 --> 18:07.711
I shouldn't be saying this

18:11.256 --> 18:13.509
just watch your back 'cause he's trash.

18:15.302 --> 18:18.097
He wasn't lying when he said
he killed people for money.

18:19.473 --> 18:21.058
He has gangster connections.

18:21.141 --> 18:21.975
Real ones.

18:23.977 --> 18:26.480
He's money-crazy. He's not even human.

18:27.648 --> 18:28.524
So what?

18:28.607 --> 18:31.193
Give him whatever money you have,
even if it's half.

18:32.069 --> 18:32.903
Otherwise?

18:34.530 --> 18:36.156
What happens if I don't?

18:42.496 --> 18:43.330
You're fucked.

18:46.333 --> 18:48.168
You'll be fucked like the rest of us.

18:57.719 --> 18:58.637
Will it be done?

19:00.097 --> 19:00.931
What?

19:03.976 --> 19:05.102
If he gets paid?

19:11.733 --> 19:12.860
Will you be okay?

20:16.715 --> 20:17.299
Why?

20:17.799 --> 20:18.634
What's goin' on?

20:19.801 --> 20:20.344
What is it?

20:22.221 --> 20:24.306
Man, I'm hungry. Ugh.

20:27.142 --> 20:28.769
CHEMISTRY LAB

20:35.317 --> 20:36.193
I'll do it.

20:36.276 --> 20:37.236
I'll take care of it.

20:39.112 --> 20:39.821
Hm?

20:40.322 --> 20:41.365
It's been three days.

20:46.954 --> 20:47.955
Fifteen million won.

20:50.582 --> 20:52.376
Once he has it, it'll end.

20:54.670 --> 20:55.712
What's this?

20:57.130 --> 20:57.798
Um,

20:58.298 --> 21:00.384
- it's from my parents.
- Are you kidding me?

21:00.467 --> 21:01.260
Huh?

21:01.343 --> 21:02.052
Your parents

21:02.678 --> 21:03.762
just gave you this?

21:04.346 --> 21:05.389
Where'd you get it?

21:06.348 --> 21:08.392
Why does that even that matter?

21:08.475 --> 21:09.685
Where'd you get it?

21:11.478 --> 21:12.312
Where's it from?

21:16.191 --> 21:17.442
I sold my father's watch.

21:18.443 --> 21:20.237
He was handing it down to me anyway, so…

21:20.737 --> 21:21.488
What an idiot,

21:21.989 --> 21:22.990
huh?

21:23.949 --> 21:26.743
Why give money to that asshole?
We can just call the police.

21:28.912 --> 21:29.788
Take this

21:29.871 --> 21:31.373
and get your watch back.

21:32.582 --> 21:35.335
They told us that going to the
police wouldn't do us any good.

21:36.503 --> 21:37.212
Beom-seok-a.

21:39.006 --> 21:39.923
Thanks a lot,

21:41.258 --> 21:43.302
But I'll handle it, don't worry about it.

21:43.802 --> 21:45.637
How the hell are you gonna handle it?

21:46.305 --> 21:48.807
- Let's just report it.
- Yeah,

21:48.890 --> 21:50.017
I'm gonna do that.

21:57.941 --> 22:00.569
That asshole makes runaway
kids do jobs for him.

22:02.988 --> 22:04.448
Do you know about Free Money?

22:04.531 --> 22:06.366
It's popular with high school kids.

22:07.909 --> 22:09.453
What? What's that?

22:09.953 --> 22:10.996
A gambling site.

22:11.496 --> 22:15.500
It gives you fifty thousand won as soon
as you join, so it's called Free Money.

22:15.834 --> 22:18.170
Gil-su's partner runs it overseas.

22:18.920 --> 22:19.963
Everything's rigged.

22:20.756 --> 22:22.424
They let you win the first few rounds.

22:22.507 --> 22:24.634
You end up making tens of millions of won.

22:24.718 --> 22:25.844
False hope.

22:25.927 --> 22:27.220
They let you keep winning.

22:28.388 --> 22:29.348
That's when it happens.

22:29.848 --> 22:32.100
You begin to lose everything that you won.

22:33.810 --> 22:35.020
Nothing is chance.

22:35.896 --> 22:39.524
Their balance of tens of millions
of won suddenly drops to zero.

22:39.608 --> 22:40.817
They go nuts.

22:42.736 --> 22:45.364
So they keep gambling trying
to win back what they lost.

22:45.864 --> 22:47.741
But how do they keep gambling?

22:48.408 --> 22:49.785
They lost their money.

22:53.497 --> 22:56.541
Gil-su has membership information,
so he approaches them and

22:56.625 --> 22:57.918
offers a private loan.

23:01.129 --> 23:04.299
All these kids obviously can't
repay the debt they owe,

23:04.800 --> 23:06.051
so they bring collateral.

23:06.843 --> 23:09.429
A few days ago,
someone even brought their mom's car.

23:11.264 --> 23:14.684
He basically makes the kids steal
money and stuff from their parents.

23:16.228 --> 23:19.314
Then he takes out private loans
using the kids' bank accounts.

23:20.357 --> 23:21.858
He makes them do dead drops for drugs,

23:22.609 --> 23:24.152
gets them involved in crimes

23:24.653 --> 23:26.113
keeping them trapped.

23:27.572 --> 23:30.742
Their housing has ledgers,
contracts, even illegal drugs.

23:30.826 --> 23:33.120
All we need to do is bring
the police over there.

23:36.039 --> 23:37.624
How'd you know about all that?

23:39.376 --> 23:40.335
Did you Google it?

23:43.922 --> 23:44.756
Uh,

23:45.257 --> 23:46.091
I-

23:46.591 --> 23:47.300
just know.

23:50.053 --> 23:53.181
Well, let's do Si-eun's great plan
right after we get something to eat.

23:53.682 --> 23:54.558
Okay?

23:55.058 --> 23:56.852
I'm so hungry I could die.

24:05.694 --> 24:06.570
Hey, one sec.

24:10.740 --> 24:11.575
Why?

24:15.787 --> 24:16.455
I'll um,

24:16.955 --> 24:18.123
go by myself.

24:19.332 --> 24:20.167
What?

24:22.210 --> 24:24.171
Hey, like you said - if
the ledgers and drugs

24:24.671 --> 24:26.882
are at their place, office, or whatever,

24:26.965 --> 24:28.800
we have to bring the police over there.

24:29.301 --> 24:30.135
Yeah,

24:30.677 --> 24:31.636
I'll call them right now.

24:31.720 --> 24:32.596
No, dude.

24:33.096 --> 24:35.807
You have to catch them there.
Photos won't do any good.

24:36.558 --> 24:39.811
So, I'll go there first
and send you the address.

24:40.395 --> 24:41.438
Come with the police.

24:42.022 --> 24:43.273
I'll stall for time.

24:43.356 --> 24:43.982
Hey.

24:44.483 --> 24:45.609
You can't go by yourself.

24:46.693 --> 24:48.487
I'm still the toughest
guy at Byuksan High.

24:48.987 --> 24:50.071
You don't trust me?

24:51.448 --> 24:52.491
It's alright. 'kay?

24:53.283 --> 24:54.117
Bye.

24:59.456 --> 25:00.707
Yeah, I think I'm maybe gonna

25:00.790 --> 25:01.791
ask her out tonight.

25:04.961 --> 25:05.795
Hey!

25:07.005 --> 25:08.548
You Three Musketeers disbanded?

25:10.926 --> 25:11.760
Hey,

25:12.010 --> 25:13.512
we're not a bunch of dicks like you.

25:13.595 --> 25:14.513
We only need one.

25:15.514 --> 25:17.349
Stop talking shit and hand it over.

25:17.432 --> 25:18.391
Right now.

25:19.351 --> 25:20.519
Before I do that,

25:21.686 --> 25:23.188
let's have a word, man to man.

25:23.271 --> 25:24.105
God --

25:26.733 --> 25:28.026
You don't have it, do you?

25:30.862 --> 25:32.239
I have something better.

25:32.322 --> 25:32.906
Hm?

25:34.491 --> 25:35.825
I mean, here's the thing.

25:36.576 --> 25:37.410
Hyung.

25:38.286 --> 25:39.829
I'm the top dog in this school.

25:41.665 --> 25:43.458
There's a way I can help you out, here.

25:43.959 --> 25:46.419
That gambling website of
yours can make a lot more money.

25:46.503 --> 25:48.547
Wait, wait, wait, wait, wait, wait, wait.

25:50.924 --> 25:52.050
How'd you know that?

25:56.012 --> 25:56.638
Him.

25:57.556 --> 25:59.349
His cousin is in my class.

25:59.933 --> 26:02.769
- He showed me the website before.
- Ahh-

26:02.852 --> 26:03.853
Mhm. Ah.

26:07.148 --> 26:10.277
Everybody gets a voucher for fifty
thousand won when they join.

26:10.986 --> 26:12.445
Instead of giving them just one,

26:12.946 --> 26:15.115
Let's do at max three vouchers per person.

26:16.116 --> 26:17.993
Then, implement a referral system.

26:19.578 --> 26:22.163
Pretty soon the whole school
will be a gambling den.

26:24.040 --> 26:27.544
I'm sure you have an office or whatever.
Let's go there, have coffee, and talk.

26:28.044 --> 26:29.212
How's that?

26:39.514 --> 26:41.141
This little hyung's ambitious.

26:42.767 --> 26:43.351
Okay,

26:43.852 --> 26:44.477
hop in.

26:44.978 --> 26:45.854
Hey, take the wheel.

26:46.354 --> 26:47.647
- Sure, Hyung.
- Oppa.

26:50.233 --> 26:52.527
Should we wait up for the other
two and take them with us?

26:52.611 --> 26:53.695
Just in case.

26:57.073 --> 26:57.991
Yeah, sure.

26:59.409 --> 27:00.285
Seong-chan, get in.

27:00.910 --> 27:02.454
The youngest is coming with me.

27:05.415 --> 27:06.333
Move it.

27:33.860 --> 27:34.819
What's that about?

27:41.242 --> 27:42.077
Hold on a minute.

27:44.746 --> 27:46.790
- They went to your place, right?
- Uh-huh.

27:47.082 --> 27:48.166
Why's he going there alone?

27:48.249 --> 27:50.669
- You're not reporting from here?
- We're going to bring the police there.

27:50.752 --> 27:51.670
What's the address?

27:52.295 --> 27:54.422
Seventeen-One,
Sanggye-ro, Nowon-gu, Seoul.

27:55.006 --> 27:57.050
It's a single-family
house with blue gates.

27:57.133 --> 27:59.260
17-1 SANGGYE, NOWON, SEOUL
HOUSE WITH BLUE DOOR

28:07.018 --> 28:07.894
Hey, taxi.

28:08.478 --> 28:09.312
Taxi.

28:18.154 --> 28:20.657
SI-EUN: IF THE ADDRESS IS RIGHT,
TEXT ANYTHING BACK

28:25.203 --> 28:26.538
Hey, hey. What are you doing?

28:28.373 --> 28:31.000
Everything's gonna be okay once
I bring the money to him.

28:31.084 --> 28:32.752
Why's Su-ho going there alone?

28:32.836 --> 28:33.878
That guy's crazy.

28:34.796 --> 28:37.173
What are we gonna do,
what if something happens?

28:39.676 --> 28:42.095
Please go to Seventeen-One,
Sanggye-ro, Nowon-gu.

28:55.650 --> 28:56.568
Yeong-a.

28:57.485 --> 28:58.528
What are you doing?

29:05.160 --> 29:07.078
Trying to make sure Gil-su goes to prison.

29:07.162 --> 29:07.996
What?

29:09.914 --> 29:12.208
He's gonna bring the police
over to our place.

29:17.297 --> 29:18.923
If we keep going like this,

29:20.341 --> 29:22.886
we're gonna be stuck in this
kind of life forever.

29:24.304 --> 29:25.972
You don't want that either, right?

29:39.903 --> 29:41.446
Stay here for a little bit, okay?

29:41.529 --> 29:42.197
Heh?

29:42.906 --> 29:43.823
Yeah, no problem.

30:03.676 --> 30:04.302
Wow,

30:04.803 --> 30:05.804
that's a pretty house.

30:06.971 --> 30:07.806
Blue gates.

30:07.889 --> 30:08.848
Hm.

30:09.599 --> 30:11.142
That's cobalt blue, right?

30:13.603 --> 30:14.521
How pretty.

30:20.902 --> 30:21.820
Let's go.

30:46.344 --> 30:47.220
Sit over there.

30:47.303 --> 30:48.137
Sit.

30:50.473 --> 30:51.724
Ah, I like your place.

30:52.225 --> 30:53.351
I'm into retro.

30:54.143 --> 30:55.061
Something to drink?

30:55.854 --> 30:58.523
I'd be grateful with just a
cup of water or something.

30:59.190 --> 31:00.024
Water?

31:03.570 --> 31:04.112
Hey,

31:04.821 --> 31:05.905
give your phone to me.

31:10.285 --> 31:11.035
Why?

31:11.536 --> 31:12.370
Ahh-

31:12.453 --> 31:13.538
I just wanna make sure.

31:14.122 --> 31:15.081
This, this, this, here.

31:15.582 --> 31:17.876
I want to find out if you've
been using it or not.

31:17.959 --> 31:18.835
I'm the type

31:19.335 --> 31:20.253
who's very

31:20.336 --> 31:22.797
sensitive about personal information.

31:25.216 --> 31:26.551
I can't work with you like that.

31:29.929 --> 31:30.763
I see, yeah.

31:33.391 --> 31:33.975
Well,

31:34.475 --> 31:35.476
you leave me no choice.

31:37.061 --> 31:37.896
Ah-

31:38.438 --> 31:39.397
Give it to me.

31:40.857 --> 31:43.151
God damn it son of a bitch.

31:43.234 --> 31:44.444
Deceive me?!

31:45.069 --> 31:48.656
You fucking-son- of -a- bitch!

31:51.659 --> 31:52.577
Give me his phone.

32:01.628 --> 32:03.379
"I'm on my way with the police?"

32:05.173 --> 32:07.592
Wow, that's a pretty house.

32:08.092 --> 32:08.968
Blue gates.

32:10.386 --> 32:11.512
Hey. Hey!

32:12.430 --> 32:13.514
What the hell is this?

32:15.099 --> 32:17.018
I thought you'd come with
your punk friends,

32:17.101 --> 32:19.312
but you called the fucking cops,
you asshole!

32:20.939 --> 32:21.606
Hey,

32:22.106 --> 32:23.858
call Seok-dae that motherfucker.

32:25.735 --> 32:26.694
All of you, come with me.

33:15.576 --> 33:16.202
Hey,

33:16.703 --> 33:17.704
are you here alone?

33:18.871 --> 33:21.666
Yes. Well, I uh, brought the

33:24.085 --> 33:25.878
I'm here to give you the money.

33:27.088 --> 33:29.090
Let my friend go first,
and I'll give it to you.

33:29.173 --> 33:32.135
Are you trying to trick me you
little shit? You son of a bitch.

33:32.218 --> 33:33.219
Follow me.

33:46.482 --> 33:48.109
This isn't even our jurisdiction.

33:56.784 --> 33:57.869
Is anybody here?

34:01.789 --> 34:02.665
Anyone?

34:04.584 --> 34:05.501
Hey kid,

34:06.044 --> 34:06.961
you sure this is it?

34:07.545 --> 34:08.379
Yes.

34:12.842 --> 34:13.676
What now?

34:16.804 --> 34:19.223
We can't um, really do anything. Right?

34:19.724 --> 34:20.683
Well,

34:21.184 --> 34:22.769
we should head out.

34:22.977 --> 34:24.520
Next time, come to the station.

34:25.646 --> 34:26.439
What?

34:27.023 --> 34:29.317
We didn't come here with a search warrant.

34:30.318 --> 34:32.653
There's no evidence at all,
just a few photographs.

34:33.154 --> 34:36.365
We'll still hand over those photos
to the Violent Crimes Unit.

34:36.449 --> 34:39.243
Come by the station to give
your statement, sometime.

34:39.869 --> 34:41.662
And pick up your phone when we call.

36:29.896 --> 36:31.022
AHN SU-HO

36:43.618 --> 36:46.329
There's a room where he keeps
all the illegal property.

36:55.129 --> 36:57.506
All the ledgers and drugs
should be in the safe.

37:03.137 --> 37:08.517
Your call cannot be completed as dialed.
Please leave a message after the tone…

39:51.931 --> 39:53.724
ALL NAMES, PLACES, AND EVENTS SHOWN
ARE FICTIONAL

39:53.808 --> 39:55.851
